#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/home_page.py:73
msgid "What is Kernel?"
msgstr "什麼是核心？"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/home_page.py:75
msgid ""
"The kernel is the heart of your operating system. It controls your "
"processor, memory, and all hardware. Most drivers already come built-in with"
" the kernel."
msgstr "核心是作業系統的中樞，負責管理處理器、記憶體與所有硬體。大多數驅動程式已內建於核心中。"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/home_page.py:86
msgid "What are Drivers?"
msgstr "什麼是驅動程式？"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/home_page.py:88
msgid ""
"Drivers allow each device — like your video card, Wi-Fi, or sound — to "
"communicate with the system. If everything is already working, you probably "
"don't need to change anything."
msgstr "驅動程式讓每個裝置 — 例如顯示卡、Wi-Fi 介面卡或音效裝置 — 能與系統通訊。如果一切運作正常，您可能不需要做任何變更。"

