msgid "At least one backup kernel must remain installed"
msgstr "必須保留至少一個已安裝的備用核心"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:433
msgid "Not removable here"
msgstr "無法在此處刪除"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:438
msgid ""
"Installed outside the package manager. Remove its files from /boot and "
"/usr/lib/modules the same way it was installed."
msgstr "未透過套件管理員安裝。請按照安裝時的方式，從 /boot 和 /usr/lib/modules 中刪除其檔案。"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:460
msgid ""
"The BigCommunity kernel (big-kernel), optimized for gaming and general use "
"(BORE, Clang ThinLTO, Intel fixes). It is installed alongside your current "
"kernel."
msgstr ""
"BigCommunity 核心（big-kernel），針對遊戲和日常使用進行了最佳化（BORE、Clang ThinLTO、Intel "
"修復）。它將與您目前的核心一起安裝。"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:465
msgid ""
"Recommended for most users. These kernels receive security updates for years"
" and are thoroughly tested."
msgstr "建議大多數使用者使用。這些核心會持續多年接收安全性更新，且經過充分測試。"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:469
msgid ""
"Always up to date with the latest features and hardware support. Good if you"
" need the newest drivers."
msgstr "始終保持最新功能和硬體支援。如果需要最新驅動程式，這是不錯的選擇。"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:473
msgid ""
"Tuned for gaming and desktop responsiveness. A good option for daily use "
"with extra performance."
msgstr "針對遊戲與桌面反應速度最佳化，適合需要額外效能的日常使用。"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:477
msgid ""
"Built for audio/video production needing precise timing. May be incompatible"
" with some drivers (e.g. NVIDIA). Only for advanced users."
msgstr "為需要精確時序的影音製作而建置。可能與某些驅動程式（如 NVIDIA）不相容。僅適合進階使用者。"

